<section class="Guidelines-quickStart u-box" id="quick-start" aria-labelledby="quick-start-heading">
  <h2 id="quick-start-heading">Quick start</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><b>Search first.</b> Do not add a brand or product that is already on HiFi&thinsp;Log.</li>
    <li><b>Enter what the brand published</b>, and write your source in the comment when you edit an entry.</li>
    <li><b>An incomplete entry is welcome.</b> If you do not know a value, leave the field empty. Do not guess.</li>
    <li><b>Different specifications make a new product.</b> When something is called "Mk II" or has a different impedance, for example, it is a different product, not a different version.</li>
    <li><b>Write descriptions yourself.</b> Do not copy text from brand websites, brochures or reviews.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
